CONTROL* h n 10 hypothesis/key n: score(n) 5 rank 1 | top5 n:5 a:3 l:3 d:2 b:1 | e 1 | decision ACCEPT n (= key)
   2046_leg_abc:24 n <- 2 words, e.g. daaten, soldaaten
