CONTROL 6 n 11 hypothesis/key s: score(s) 4 rank 1 | top5 s:4 d:3 w:3 b:2 f:2 | e 1 | decision UNDECIDED
   2046_leg_abc:9 s <- 1 words, e.g. officiers
